# Black Panther, Hope Enduring blocks Preacher of the Schism (2/4 deathtouch). In the first-strike combat damage step
# Black Panther deals 3 (double strike, CR 702.4b); in the regular step it deals 3 more, and the Preacher deals its 2 at
# the same time - which "Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Black Panther" prevents (CR 615.1). Deathtouch needs
# damage dealt (CR 702.2b), so Black Panther lives with no damage marked, and the Preacher, with 6 damage, dies. The
# prevention of combat damage is recorded once, by Black Panther.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
King T'Challa
Island
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Preacher of the Schism
Island x25

