Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.King T'Challa.Cast(Ability: back face)
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot2.Hand.Preacher of the Schism.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Preacher of the Schism > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Black Panther, Hope Enduring > Preacher of the Schism)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

